%[text] Run sections from top to bottom in a fresh MATLAB session. This demonstration requires MATLAB R2025a or later and base MATLAB only. Locked inputs: `y0_m=0 m`, `v0_mps=20 m s^-1`, `g_mps2=9.81 m s^-2`, and `t_s=0:0.1:4 s`.

